  intro D L hT Gi Gl Kc Dx cX ex u μ w hg Lv I H X _ std t J S hD hSpl hP v π hπ j hj a b ha hb La Lb La' Lb' hab hab'
  have hR := GlobalTheory.TwV.DelB.sysS_ranks S
